{
  "name": "Ice Devil",
  "type": "consumable",
  "img": "icons/consumables/potions/bottle-ornate-bat-teal.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">You become an ice devil for 1 min. You do not just polymorph into one you actually become one.<br />You can not willingly dismiss the effect.<br />Afterwards your mind is corrupted for a couple of days while the effect wears off.</span></p><p></p><p>IceDevil:</p><ul><li><p>You are selfcentered, egoistic, you have no sense of emphaty,</p></li><li><p>You see your companions as slaves, lesser fouls that might be usefull to you, if not you are willing to sacrifice them.</p></li><li><p>Your main motivation is to get promoted by slaughtering enemies and claiming as many souls as possible.</p></li></ul><p></p><p>Corrupted Mind:</p><ul><li><p>You do not remember what happend</p></li><li><p>You feel like you have lost some great power and someone is to blame for it.</p></li><li><p>You have the feeling everyone is lying to you and your companions are only selfish and do not want the best of you.</p></li></ul>",
